# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Account book — your customer list. Do not commit.
#
# data/ holds ~220 named clinics with doctor names, gatekeeper names, internal
# email addresses, purchasing status and Top 25 flags. Keep it out of the repo
# even if the repo is private: git history is forever, and a repo that starts
# private does not always stay that way.
#
# Everything needed to REBUILD the book is tracked (tools/build-book.ps1 and the
# app itself); only the data is excluded.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
!data/README.md

